NAME

user - Manage user accounts

SYNOPSIS

    user
    user list
    user show <name>
    user create <name>
    user password [<name>]
    user remove <name>
    user remove [-p|--purge] <name>
    user role <name> <regular|admin>

DESCRIPTION

Manage user accounts.

OPTIONS

    -p, --purge — Delete the user's home directory when removing.
    -h, --help — Show this help.

